msgid "Largest contentful paint"
msgstr "Største indholdsvisning"

#: includes/class-admin.php:323
msgid "Cumulative layout shift"
msgstr "Samlet layoutforskydning"

#: includes/class-admin.php:326
msgid "Interaction to next paint"
msgstr "Interaktion til næste optegning"

#: includes/class-admin.php:329
msgid "Time to first byte"
msgstr "Tid til første byte"

#: includes/class-admin.php:332
msgid "DOM content loaded"
msgstr "DOM-indhold indlæst"

#: includes/class-admin.php:335
msgid "Load"
msgstr "Indlæsning"

#: includes/class-admin.php:339
msgid "Long tasks"
msgstr "Lange opgaver"

#. translators: 1: number of long tasks, 2: their total duration in milliseconds
#: includes/class-admin.php:342
#, php-format
msgid "%1$d (%2$d ms total)"
msgstr "%1$d (%2$d ms i alt)"

#: includes/class-admin.php:350
msgid "JS heap"
msgstr "JS-heap"

#. translators: 1: megabytes of JS heap used, 2: the heap limit in megabytes
#: includes/class-admin.php:353
#, php-format
msgid "%1$d MB of %2$d MB"
msgstr "%1$d MB af %2$d MB"

#: includes/class-admin.php:363
msgid "Performance"
msgstr "Ydelse"

#: includes/class-admin.php:365
msgid "What the page cost on the visit the report came from. Two of these are simplifications: the layout shift is the sum of the shifts, and the interaction figure is the worst one rather than a percentile."
msgstr "Hvad siden kostede på det besøg, rapporten kom fra. To af tallene er forenklinger: layoutforskydningen er summen af forskydningerne, og interaktionstallet er det værste frem for en percentil."

#: includes/class-admin.php:405
msgid "Cookies"
msgstr "Cookies"

#: includes/class-admin.php:416
msgid "Storage"
msgstr "Lager"

#: includes/class-admin.php:418
msgid "Key names and how long their values were, and the names of the cookies. Never a value, and never a cookie value at all — unless the site allow-listed a key, in which case its value is below because somebody asked for it."
msgstr "Nøglenavne og hvor lange deres værdier var, samt navnene på cookies. Aldrig en værdi, og aldrig en cookieværdi overhovedet — medmindre sitet har tilladt en nøgle, og så står værdien nedenfor, fordi nogen har bedt om den."

#. translators: 1: site name, 2: report title
#: includes/class-email.php:77
#, php-format
msgid "[%1$s] %2$s"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:386
msgid "Timings and storage snapshot"
msgstr "Tider og øjebliksbillede af lageret"

#: includes/class-settings.php:390
msgid "Record how the page performed, and which keys the browser had stored"
msgstr "Registrér hvordan siden præsterede, og hvilke nøgler browseren havde gemt"

#: includes/class-settings.php:392
msgid "Off by default. The timings are the ones a web vitals report shows: largest contentful paint, layout shift, interaction to next paint, time to first byte, the load events, long tasks and — in Chrome — the JavaScript heap."
msgstr "Slået fra som standard. Tiderne er dem, en web vitals-rapport viser: største indholdsvisning, layoutforskydning, interaktion til næste optegning, tid til første byte, indlæsningshændelserne, lange opgaver og — i Chrome — JavaScript-heapen."

#: includes/class-settings.php:393
msgid "The storage snapshot lists the key names in localStorage and sessionStorage with the length of each value, and the names of the cookies. It never records a value, and never a cookie value at all. A key name can still say something — \"impersonating_user\" is a fact about the visit — so read the report screen before you forward one."
msgstr "Øjebliksbilledet af lageret viser nøglenavnene i localStorage og sessionStorage med længden af hver værdi, samt navnene på cookies. Det registrerer aldrig en værdi, og aldrig en cookieværdi overhovedet. Et nøglenavn kan stadig sige noget — \"impersonating_user\" er en oplysning om besøget — så læs rapportskærmen, før du sender en videre."

#: includes/class-settings.php:397
msgid "Shake to report"
msgstr "Ryst for at rapportere"

#: includes/class-settings.php:401
msgid "Open the panel when the phone is shaken"
msgstr "Åbn panelet når telefonen rystes"

#: includes/class-settings.php:403
msgid "Off by default. It is the gesture a phone has instead of a keyboard shortcut: three shakes inside a second, with a three-second pause afterwards so one gesture opens one panel."
msgstr "Slået fra som standard. Det er den gestus, en telefon har i stedet for en tastaturgenvej: tre ryk inden for ét sekund og derefter tre sekunders pause, så én gestus åbner ét panel."

#. translators: %s: the JavaScript call a theme has to make, already wrapped in <code>
#: includes/class-settings.php:408
#, php-format
msgid "On iPhone and iPad, Safari only reports motion after the visitor has agreed to it, and it will only ask from a button the visitor pressed. This plugin never puts up that prompt for you. If you want the gesture there, call %s from a button of your own; everywhere else it works as soon as you tick this box."
msgstr "På iPhone og iPad rapporterer Safari først bevægelse, når den besøgende har sagt ja, og den spørger kun fra en knap, den besøgende har trykket på. Dette plugin viser aldrig den dialog for dig. Vil du have gestussen der, så kald %s fra din egen knap; alle andre steder virker den, så snart du sætter dette flueben."

#: includes/class-settings.php:430
msgid "The bundled panel signs what it sends, so filling this in is all there is to it. A report sent by anything else — your own form, a script — has to sign the same way."
msgstr "Det medfølgende panel signerer det, det sender, så det er alt, der skal til at udfylde feltet her. En rapport sendt af noget andet — din egen formular, et script — skal signere på samme måde."

#. translators: %s: the title of the report, which is its first line.
#: includes/class-admin.php:169
#, php-format
msgid "The page as the reporter saw it when they sent %s."
msgstr "Siden, som anmelderen så den, da de sendte %s."

#: includes/class-settings.php:354
msgid "Screenshots"
msgstr "Skærmbilleder"

#: includes/class-settings.php:358
msgid "Let the reporter attach a picture of the page"
msgstr "Lad anmelderen vedhæfte et billede af siden"

#: includes/class-settings.php:360
msgid "Off by default. Taking a picture needs a renderer, and a renderer is a second script of about 15 kB (6 kB over the wire) on every page the panel is on, so it is only loaded when this box is ticked. Until version 0.4.1 the plugin shipped no renderer at all and the panel never offered a picture."
msgstr "Slået fra som udgangspunkt. Et billede kræver en renderer, og en renderer er endnu et script på omkring 15 kB (6 kB over ledningen) på hver eneste side, hvor panelet vises, så det hentes kun, når dette felt er sat. Indtil version 0.4.1 fulgte der slet ingen renderer med pluginet, og panelet tilbød aldrig et billede."

#: includes/class-settings.php:361
msgid "A picture of the page contains whatever was on the page."
msgstr "Et billede af siden indeholder alt, hvad der stod på siden."

#: includes/class-settings.php:361
msgid "The name of another customer, a price, an order, a message that was open in a tab beside the bug. Reports are a private post type and the picture is served only to people who can read them, through a plugin route of its own rather than the media library — but everyone who can read a report sees it, and forwarding one forwards the picture. Ask for screenshots only if you would be comfortable reading them."
msgstr "En anden kundes navn, en pris, en ordre, en besked der lå åben i en fane ved siden af fejlen. Rapporter er en privat indholdstype, og billedet leveres kun til dem, der må læse dem, gennem pluginets egen rute frem for mediebiblioteket — men alle, der kan læse en rapport, kan se billedet, og videresender du en rapport, videresender du billedet. Bed kun om skærmbilleder, hvis du selv ville være tryg ved at læse dem."

#. translators: 1: the data-bugbottle-mask attribute, wrapped in <code>; 2: the data-bugbottle-block attribute, wrapped in <code>
#: includes/class-settings.php:366
#, php-format
msgid "What is typed into a field is replaced with bullets before the picture is taken. Mark anything else you do not want in it with %1$s to bullet its text, or %2$s to cover it entirely."
msgstr "Det, der er skrevet i et felt, erstattes med prikker, før billedet tages. Marker alt andet, du ikke vil have med, med %1$s for at skjule teksten bag prikker, eller %2$s for at dække det helt."

#: includes/class-settings.php:372
msgid "The reporter sees the picture before it is sent, can untick it, and can mark it first: a rectangle, an arrow, and a blur that reads the region back out of the canvas so the original pixels leave with it."
msgstr "Anmelderen ser billedet, før det sendes, kan fravælge det og kan markere i det først: et rektangel, en pil og en sløring, der læser området tilbage fra lærredet, så de oprindelige pixels forsvinder med den."

#: includes/class-admin.php:147
msgid "Contact"
msgstr "Kontakt"

#: includes/class-admin.php:149
msgid "How the reporter said they can be reached. They typed it themselves and nothing checked it, so it may be a phone number, a name in a chat, or a typo."
msgstr "Sådan siger rapportøren, at man kan få fat i vedkommende. De har skrevet det selv, og intet har kontrolleret det, så det kan være et telefonnummer, et navn i en chat eller en tastefejl."

#: includes/class-settings.php:324
msgid "Contact field"
msgstr "Kontaktfelt"

#: includes/class-settings.php:327
msgid "Ask the reporter how to reach them"
msgstr "Spørg rapportøren, hvordan man får fat i vedkommende"

#: includes/class-settings.php:335
msgid "Off by default. It adds one field under the message asking how the reporter can be reached, because \"the save button does nothing\" is worth a reply. Nothing checks what they type: a phone number or a name in your own chat is a good answer, and required only means the panel will not send an empty field."
msgstr "Slået fra som udgangspunkt. Det tilføjer ét felt under beskeden, hvor der spørges, hvordan man får fat i rapportøren — for \"gem-knappen gør ingenting\" fortjener et svar. Intet kontrollerer, hvad de skriver: et telefonnummer eller et navn i jeres egen chat er et godt svar, og påkrævet betyder kun, at panelet ikke sender et tomt felt."

#: includes/class-settings.php:336
msgid "The contact field is personal data you asked for."
msgstr "Kontaktfeltet er personoplysninger, I selv har bedt om."

#: includes/class-settings.php:336
msgid "Store it like one: it is kept where the rest of the report is kept, it goes when you delete the report, and it is shown to everyone who can read reports. Asking for an address is also a promise to answer, and that promise is yours to make."
msgstr "Behandl dem derefter: de gemmes samme sted som resten af rapporten, de forsvinder, når I sletter rapporten, og de vises til alle, der kan læse rapporter. At bede om en adresse er samtidig et løfte om at svare, og det løfte er jeres at give."

#: includes/class-settings.php:337
msgid "When the line looks like an email address, the notification email is sent with it as Reply-To, so replying answers the reporter."
msgstr "Når linjen ligner en e-mailadresse, sendes notifikationsmailen med den som Reply-To, så et svar på mailen går til rapportøren."

#: includes/class-settings.php:473
msgid "Do not ask"
msgstr "Spørg ikke"

#: includes/class-settings.php:474
msgid "Ask, but let them send without it"
msgstr "Spørg, men lad dem sende uden"

#: includes/class-settings.php:475
msgid "Ask, and refuse to send without it"
msgstr "Spørg, og afvis at sende uden"
